{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><h1>石鼓洲焚化廠三級火 消防出動兩喉兩煙帽隊撲救</h1><p>更新時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"石鼓洲焚化廠發生三級火警。Chloe Wan ＦＢ\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b392d75a1321fa531f75ddf08275d100/2026-10/c_0_5.jpg\"><p>今(26日) 衲12時43分，石鼓洲綜合廢物管理設施第1期發生火警，消防接報到場，在中午1時24分，將火警升為三級火，正出動兩喉兩煙帽隊在場撲救，暫時沒有傷亡報告。</p><img alt=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f951557f3310749a6bb544ae443a85ec/2026-10/0007bd4d-bf86-48ec-bffb-4ff01697a9c0.jpg\" title=\"焚化廠冒出濃煙。\"><p>焚化廠冒出濃煙。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:43.677295+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:12:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:31.052397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:31.052397+00:00","content_hash":"7e2456d795263d08d03f74a13b0019f15866590d0c90805c2c41aac88d2053d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}